            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a support structure (40) for a medicament container (18), which support structure (40) is arranged to accommodate an elongated plunger rod (32), said support structure (40) comprising at least one flexible element (48) arranged to be moved in contact with, and to exert a force, on a distal end surface of said medicament container (18), wherein said at least one flexible element (48) is provided with a contact member (50) arranged to contact an outer surface of said plunger rod (32) and to be moved out of contact with said plunger rod (32 ) when moved in contact with said medicament container (18).</p>
            </abstract>
